    "Say \"Hey Siri, play [channel name]\" to start listening to your favorite DR radio channels.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sig \"Hey Siri, afspil [kanalnavn]\" for at lytte til dine foretrukne DR-kanaler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Say “Play P3” — Siri learns that Lytter is where you listen to the radio. With the app's name there is more: “Stop Lytter in 30 minutes”, “Stop Lytter after this programme”, “What's on Lytter?”. The same actions are in the Shortcuts app.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sig “Spil P3” – Siri lærer, at det er i Lytter, du hører radio. Med appens navn kan du mere: “Stop Lytter om 30 minutter”, “Stop Lytter efter dette program”, “Hvad sendes der i Lytter?”. De samme handlinger findes i appen Genveje."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Says which programme is on a station now.": {
